OL,3,GNEWSAFresh measures to secure derelict
OL,4,ADebenhams building
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is ongoing to stop youths
OL,7,Faccessing the roof of the former
OL,8,FDebenhams building in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre, police have said.
OL,11,FReports of young people accessing the
OL,12,Fbuilding in Long Row, off Old Market
OL,13,FSquare, have led to a closure order,
OL,14,Fwhich has now been extended until 20
OL,15,FNovember.
OL,17,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,18,Fwere working with the site owners and
OL,19,FNottingham City Council to "ensure the
OL,20,Fbuilding is better secured".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
